jt-pve-storage-dellemc (0.7.38~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use. No storage type has been run
    against physical hardware.
  * PowerStore could not have reported its capacity. space_metrics_by_cluster
    was read as a REST collection; it is an ENTITY NAME for the metrics
    service, which is reached with POST /metrics/generate and
    {entity, entity_id, interval}. On an array that does not expose the
    series as a collection, status() returned undef and the storage showed
