jt-pve-storage-dellemc (0.7.16~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use. No storage type has been run
    against physical hardware.
  * PowerVault could not tell whether a volume was already mapped to this
    node. 'show maps' reports one row per initiator, with the columns Serial
    Number, Name, Ports, LUN, Access, Identifier, Nickname and Profile — there
    is no host-name column at all, so comparing against a host name always
    answered no. Every activation would have remapped the volume and taken
