jt-pve-storage-dellemc (0.7.13~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use. No storage type has been run
    against physical hardware.
  * New test t/19-powervault-lifecycle.t completes the set: each of the three
