jt-pve-storage-dellemc (0.7.1~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use. No storage type has been run
    against physical hardware.
  * The VM config backup volume is no longer offered on the dellpowervault
    family. It spends one extra volume for every snapshot of a VM, and a
    PowerVault ME array's volume and snapshot ceiling is roughly an order of
    magnitude below PowerStore's, so the cost is material there. Snapshots
